<title>ARGENTINA: Argentine market makers exercise T-bills option.</title>
<headline>Argentine market makers exercise T-bills option.</headline>
<dateline>BUENOS AIRES 1997-05-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Argentine market makers Tuesday exercised options for additional Treasury bills, purchasing 11.92 million pesos of 91-day Letes and $6.08 million of 182-day Letes, the Economy Ministry said.</p>
<p>Earlier in the day the ministry placed 250 million pesos of 91-day Letes and $250 million of 182-day Letes.</p>
<p>((--David Haskel, Buenos Aires Newsroom +541 318-0652))</p>
